('nasa-clarity','nasa-handbook-2016',207,'198','Apêndice C.4 · Clarity','Do the requirements express only one thought per requirement statement, a stand-alone statement as opposed to multiple requirements in a single statement, or a paragraph that contains both requirements and rationale?','Are the requirements concise and simple? ',' Does the requirement statement have one subject','[[0.11875000000000001, 0.6500171957671957, 0.4843644097222222, 0.668510582010582], [0.11875000000000001, 0.6691970899470899, 0.4843472222222222, 0.6876904761904762], [0.11875000000000001, 0.6883769841269841, 0.47823611111111103, 0.7068703703703704], [0.4782640625, 0.6883769841269841, 0.48437517361111104, 0.7068703703703704], [0.11875000000000001, 0.7075568783068783, 0.4781425347222224, 0.7260502645502646], [0.4782640625, 0.7075568783068783, 0.48437517361111104, 0.7260502645502646], [0.11875000000000001, 0.7267367724867725, 0.27111336805555564, 0.7452301587301587]]',true),
('nasa-verification','nasa-handbook-2016',209,'200','Apêndice C.4 · Verifiability/Testability','Are the requirements free of unverifiable terms (e.g., flexible, easy, sufficient, safe, ad hoc, adequate, accommodate, user-friendly, usable, when required, if required, appropriate, fast, portable, light-weight, small, large, maximize, minimize, sufficient, robust, quickly, easily, clearly, other “ly” words, other “ize” words)?','requirements? ','Data Usage ','[[0.5406249999999999, 0.11298015873015872, 0.9062298611111115, 0.131473544973545], [0.5406249999999999, 0.1321600529100529, 0.8999984374999997, 0.15065343915343915], [0.9001390625, 0.1321600529100529, 0.906250173611111, 0.15065343915343915], [0.5406249999999999, 0.15133994708994708, 0.9062585069444449, 0.16983333333333334], [0.5406249999999999, 0.1705198412698413, 0.9062776041666668, 0.18901322751322752], [0.5406249999999999, 0.18969973544973545, 0.9062374999999996, 0.2081931216931217], [0.5406249999999999, 0.20887962962962964, 0.9062546874999998, 0.2273730158730159], [0.5406249999999999, 0.22805952380952382, 0.7675706597222223, 0.24655291005291005]]',true),
('nasa-form','nasa-handbook-2016',206,'197','Apêndice C.1 e C.2 · Product Requirement','The requirement is in the form “product ABC shall XYZ.” A requirement should state “The product shall” (do, perform, provide, weigh, or other verb) followed by a description of what should be done.','Product Requirement ',' The requirement uses consistent terminology to','[[0.11874826388888889, 0.6116574074074074, 0.48434166666666667, 0.6301507936507936], [0.11874826388888889, 0.630834656084656, 0.4843607638888891, 0.6493280423280423], [0.11874826388888889, 0.6500119047619047, 0.4844237847222224, 0.668505291005291], [0.11874826388888889, 0.6691891534391533, 0.48434739583333364, 0.6876825396825396]]',true),
